
>> shop := (Lugʻat yangi
	qoʻyish: ['magazine'] kalit: ['books'],
	qoʻyish: ['computer'] kalit: ['electronics'],
	qoʻyish: ['lipstick'] kalit: ['cosmetics']
).
Chiqish yozish: (shop bormi: ['computer']), yangi-qator. 
Chiqish yozish: (shop bormi: ['sausage']), yangi-qator. 
Chiqish yozish: (shop bormi: ['computers']), yangi-qator. 
Chiqish yozish: (shop bormi: ['compute']), yangi-qator. 
Chiqish yozish: (shop bormi: ['2computer']), yangi-qator. 
